  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Medium Coverage</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Stick Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Matte Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A lightweight, blurring lipstick that gives a sheer, soft-matte wash of color with a smooth, balm-like texture that feels comfortable all day.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Gel-Wrapped Pigments: For smooth, buildable color.</p><p>- Sesame Seed Active: Boosts hydration for smoother lips.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>What Else You Need to Know:</strong> This lightweight, buildable formula delivers sheer-matte lip color with the comfort of a nourishing balm. Gel-wrapped pigments glide on smoothly for a diffused, soft-focus finish, while a clinically backed sesame-based active helps boost hydration for smoother, softer lips.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Clean at Sephora</strong></p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Dab onto lips for a subtle wash of color. <br>-Layer for more color intensity. <br>-Reapply throughout the day as needed.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Gel-Wrapped Pigments: For smooth, buildable color.<br>-Sesame Seed Active: Boosts hydration for smoother lips.<br><br>All shades: Dimethicone, Ethylhexyl Palmitate, Synthetic Wax, Calcium Carbonate, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Hydrogenated Olive Oil, Kaolin, Polyglyceryl-3 Diisostearate, Dimethicone/Vinyl Dimethicone Crosspolymer, Euphorbia Cerifera (Candelilla) Wax (Euphorbia Cerifera Cera/Cire de candelilla), Olea Europaea (Olive) Fruit Oil, Stearalkonium Hectorite, Olea Europaea (Olive) Oil Unsaponifiables, Dimethyl Isosorbide, Propylene Carbonate, Isopropyl Titanium Triisostearate, Sesamum Indicum (Sesame) Seed Extract, Tocopherol; May Contain/Peut Contenir (+/-): CI 77891 (Titanium Dioxide), CI 77491 / CI 77492 /CI 77499 (Iron Oxides), CI 45410 (Red 27 Lake), CI 15850 (Red 7 Lake), CI 42090 (Blue 1 Lake), CI 19140 (Yellow 5 Lake), CI 17200 (Red 33 Lake), CI 73360 (Red 30 Lake). <br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change. Please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
